{"key":"ff3af436116d34adabf1d9d7cc843e00c445c893d287537e47cfbb2155dc7ee6","quote":"If the line is a charge the customer agreed to, explain it in one or two sentences.","text":"{\"limits\": [{\"limit\": 2, \"comparison\": \"le\", \"unit\": \"sentences\"}]}","usage":{"input":399,"output":36}}
