{"key":"430dee2c7aa57b6bcf15e66db31cdeee06094a00f782540bf286b19170305718","quote":"Say it looks like a duplicate and that billing will check it within five working days","text":"{\"limits\": [{\"limit\": 5, \"comparison\": \"le\", \"unit\": \"working days\"}]}","usage":{"input":536,"output":35}}
{"key":"0024196f5276c1cbd7e18d86916ad205ecee0b2f1846c07d16d6d79d91c01dcb","quote":"A credit is missing","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":520,"output":9}}
