{"key":"c3c936dd14b780135b96fd8e71b27eb3968272d6c48b4336742a8149e5eb3cd7","quote":"Do not tell them it is lost until five working days have passed.","text":"{\"limits\": [{\"limit\": 5, \"comparison\": \"ge\", \"unit\": \"working days\"}]}","usage":{"input":389,"output":36}}
