{"key":"d2d745268b63f30305e6c8c1e3d488534851760b489f39e525abba78f0dd7540","quote":"If they ask why we want the router back, say plainly that it is ours and that we reuse it.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":398,"output":9}}
