{"key":"6abf328cb7ae66fa8fb3b9da18b4fa96bd58f8384bbd526cefc1e3cf428179e5","quote":"Offer the two next free morning slots and the two next free afternoon slots.","text":"{\"limits\": [{\"limit\": 2, \"comparison\": \"le\", \"unit\": \"morning slots offered\"}, {\"limit\": 2, \"comparison\": \"le\", \"unit\": \"afternoon slots offered\"}]}","usage":{"input":393,"output":71}}
